# Vidhi Kansara — Personal Portfolio

You are building the personal portfolio of **Vidhi Kansara** — a new grad software engineer at the intersection of **AI engineering** and **full-stack development**.

## Two jobs of the site

1. Show she builds **AI products that ship to production** (RAG, LLMs, MLOps, agents).
2. Show she can build the **frontend** — the portfolio itself is proof.

